# The 1-month error came from the statsmodels convention alpha_(t+1) = c_t + T alpha_t: the
# state intercept at t drives the level at t + 1, so month t's term was attributed to month
# t + 1 and the forecast peaked 1 month early. The user saw it in the hindcast charts.
